    "short_description": "BDO Morocco is a member firm of BDO International, one of the largest global networks of audit and consulting firms. Established in 1979, it operates with a team of approximately 164 professionals and generates around $27 million in revenue, primarily serving the financial services sector. The firm is headquartered in Casablanca and has additional offices in Rabat and Casa Business Towers.\n\nBDO Morocco offers a wide range of professional services, including audit and assurance, accounting expertise and outsourcing, general consulting, tax and legal advisory, and corporate finance services. The firm is known for its multidisciplinary team, which includes accountants, auditors, lawyers, and tax experts, all dedicated to providing high-value services to businesses of various sizes. Leadership is provided by President Zakaria Fahim and General Director Mostafa Fraiha.",
